{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": -280,
      "y": -460,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# 🌊 rheopy\n\n**Open rheology, end to end.**\n\nOne ecosystem built around complete expert workflows — not disconnected tools. Every bundle pairs:\n\n- 📄 the science (papers, models)\n- 💾 curated data\n- 🔧 analysis tools\n- 📏 measurement protocols\n- 💻 zero-setup browser experience\n\n**measure → data → model → fit → explore**",
      "id": "91a21a89411abda4"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": -820,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "## 📏 rheomeasurement\n\ndocument and share measurment protocols\n\n*[protocols landing here]*\n\n[→ github.com/rheopy/rheomeasurement](https://github.com/rheopy/rheomeasurement)",
      "id": "8395fd264a84a940"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": -400,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "## 💾 rheodata 📊\n\n**Curated, quality-checked rheology datasets — for training, simulation, and benchmarking.**\n\n`pip install rheopy-rheodata` — every dataset carries provenance, measurement record, and citation.\n\n[→ github.com/rheopy/rheodata](https://github.com/rheopy/rheodata)",
      "id": "be10a06272e8ab6a"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "## 🧪 rheomodel\n\nNine flow-curve models as pure Python functions — equations, parameters, bounds, and **verified academic citations**.\n\n`pip install rheopy-rheomodel`\n\n[→ github.com/rheopy/rheomodel](https://github.com/rheopy/rheomodel)",
      "id": "f60cd2057a15980c"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "## ⚗️ rheofit\n\n**Turn flow curves into material physics** — yield stress, zero-shear viscosity, relaxation time, shear-thinning index.\n\n[📖 docs](https://rheofit.readthedocs.io/) · [→ github.com/rheopy/rheofit](https://github.com/rheopy/rheofit)",
      "id": "104232b0588e4a08"
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 520,
      "url": "https://rheopy.github.io/rheolite/",
      "id": "92e5cdc3b0aac86d"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": -820,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "## 💧 capillary-breakup\n\nVideo analysis for CaBER extensional rheometry: video in → filament neck vs time → viscosity via the Papageorgiou solution.\n\n`pip install rheopy-caber`\n\n[📖 docs](https://capillary-breakup.readthedocs.io/) · [→ repo](https://github.com/rheopy/capillary-breakup)",
      "id": "7c21675210b2e3fe"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": -400,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "text": "## 🔩 rheoflow\n\nNon-Newtonian flow calculators — pipes, slits, annulus. Take a fitted model straight to pressure drop and flow rate.\n\n[📖 docs](https://rheoflow.readthedocs.io/) · [→ repo](https://github.com/rheopy/rheoflow)",
      "id": "9544d826ea70e9c9"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": -820,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "## ⚗️ rheopy org\n\n**Open rheology, end to end** — from curated measurements to guarded model fits to in-browser exploration.\n\n[→ github.com/rheopy](https://github.com/rheopy)",
      "id": "49f7807245ebe929"
    },
    {
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1350,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 1400,
      "label": "📦 Bundles — complete workflows",
      "id": "ee069ed92d23d088"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": -440,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 📈 Flow curves\n\n**rheomodel** (9 models, verified citations) + **rheofit** (nonlinear regression engine) + **rheodata** (14 curated datasets) + **rheolite** walkthrough notebooks.\n\nFit a flow curve in the browser — Herschel–Bulkley vs TC vs Carreau, zero setup.",
      "id": "fc255778a43ed129"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 💧 CaBER / extensional\n\n**capillary-breakup** (`pip install rheopy-caber`): video → filament thinning → viscosity via the Papageorgiou solution.\n\nThe **rheolite** CaBER quickstart runs it in the browser — and the test clip plays right here →",
      "id": "4a281e92b71a73bf"
    },
    {
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 315,
      "file": "assets/test_clip.mp4",
      "id": "165b2af09c47880d"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 395,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## 🌀 Oscillatory rheology\n\n**rheodata** ships amplitude + frequency sweeps; the Cox–Merz and Delaware–Rutgers rules bridge oscillatory → steady shear.",
      "id": "e745dbd30343c584"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 615,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## 🔩 Engineering flows\n\n**rheoflow**: pipe, slit & annulus calculators — take a fitted model straight to pressure drop and flow rate.",
      "id": "8fccb72d43d15545"
    }
  ],
